msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima's outside making a phone＿call. Apparently she's calling her mom.＿She didn't have to go outside though.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima salió a hacer una llamada.＿Al parecer está llamando a su mamá.＿Aunque no hacía falta que saliera.」"

msgid "Taiga「Let her do what she wants. It's＿probably something she doesn't want＿you to overhear.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Déjala hacer lo que quiera. Seguro es＿algo que no quiere que escuches.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe so. Oh well. In any case......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Puede ser. En fin. De todos modos......」"

msgid "Both「*Sigh*～」"
msgstr "Ambos「*Suspiro*～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Jeez～ I'm beat.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Caray～ Estoy agotado.」"

msgid "Taiga「When that bee flew up my skirt, I＿thought my heart was going to stop......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cuando esa abeja se metió bajo＿mi falda, pensé que se me paraba＿el corazón......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? You should be happy. We're one＿step closer to Kitamura's happiness.＿Oh, that reminds me--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? Deberías estar feliz. Estamos＿un paso más cerca de la felicidad de＿Kitamura. Ah, eso me recuerda--」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've always wanted to ask you...... Did＿something happen between you and＿Kanou Sumire?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Siempre quise preguntarte...... ¿Pasó＿algo entre tú y Kanou Sumire?」"

msgid "Taiga「......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You got all grumpy as soon as you laid＿eyes on her, and Kawashima wouldn't＿tell me anything about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te pusiste de mal humor en cuanto＿la viste, y Kawashima no quiso contarme＿nada al respecto.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine. You don't have to force＿yourself to remember.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No importa. No tienes que＿forzarte a recordar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What if I compromise the plan by＿unwittingly stepping on a land mine?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y si arruino el plan por pisar una＿mina terrestre sin darme cuenta?」"

msgid "Taiga「You'd compromise it more if you knew.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Lo arruinarías más si lo supieras.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? I don't see how I would.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? No veo cómo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Figure it out, stupid dog...... Ouch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Piénsalo, perro tonto...... ¡Ay!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? What happened?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? ¿Qué pasó?」"

msgid "Taiga「......My feet kinda hurt.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Me duelen un poco los pies.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Lemme take a look...... Aww, you're all＿scraped up. When did this happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Déjame ver...... Ay, estás toda＿raspada. ¿Cuándo pasó esto?」"

msgid "Taiga「I dunno. Might have been when I was＿freaking out about that bee in my＿skirt.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No sé. Puede que haya sido cuando me＿asusté con esa abeja en mi falda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now where is that first aid kit......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora, ¿dónde está el botiquín......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come on, lemme take a closer look......＿Wait, you didn't notice this until just＿now? Just how slow are you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ven, déjame ver más de cerca......＿Espera, ¿no te diste cuenta hasta ahora?＿¿Qué tan distraída eres?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, shut it......! Crap, it hurts more just＿from looking at it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah, cállate......! Rayos, duele＿más con solo mirarlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just pretend you didn't see it then. I'll＿put gauze on it for you. Come on, hold＿still so I can do this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces haz como si no lo vieras.＿Te pondré una gasa. Vamos, quédate＿quieta para que pueda hacerlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......The first aid kit.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......El botiquín.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm?」"

msgid "Taiga「You knew where it was without even＿having to ask.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sabías dónde estaba sin siquiera＿tener que preguntar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's like it's ingrained in me, the same＿way housework is. Jeez, you've pushed＿me around a lot, haven't you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es como si lo tuviera grabado, igual＿que las tareas del hogar. Vaya que＿me has dado órdenes, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「You're a paragon of a loyal dog. You＿have my praise.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eres todo un ejemplo de perro＿leal. Tienes mi elogio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gee, thanks...... There, all done.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya, gracias...... Listo, ya quedó.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I picked a fight with Kanou Sumire.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Busqué pelea con Kanou Sumire.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up already. Learn the small＿details on your own!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate ya. ¡Averigua los pequeños＿detalles por tu cuenta!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I would if I could.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo haría si pudiera.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh, there's no getting around it......＿And StuChi is taking her sweet time,＿so tell me what you want to know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ugh, no hay más remedio...... Y StuChi＿se está tomando todo su tiempo, así＿que dime qué quieres saber.」"

msgid "Taiga「However, you're not allowed to ask＿about the reason behind the fight!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sin embargo, no tienes permitido＿preguntar el motivo de la pelea!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what's the point......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Entonces qué sentido tiene......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's what I'm most curious about,＿but...... Maybe I should try to carefully＿prod it out of her?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso es lo que más curiosidad me＿da, pero...... ¿Tal vez deba intentar＿sacárselo con cuidado?）」"

msgid "Talk to her"
msgstr "Hablar con ella"

msgid "Don't talk to her"
msgstr "No hablar con ella"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah, it's all good. Seems like it'd be＿best not to distract myself with＿unnecessary information.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nah, no hace falta. Parece que＿es mejor no distraerme con información＿innecesaria.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whatever. Make some tea then, Ryuuji.＿I'd like apple tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea. Prepara té entonces,＿Ryuuji. Quiero té de manzana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't see how you could go from＿not talking to making tea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No entiendo cómo pasaste＿de no hablar a preparar té.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ah, never mind on that apple tea! I'm＿gonna go buy some yogurt!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah, olvida ese té de manzana!＿¡Voy a ir a comprar yogur!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kawashima, please come back soon......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kawashima, por favor＿vuelve pronto......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh! Nice timing, Kawashima!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh! ¡Justo a tiempo, Kawashima!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I knew it. I can't think of anyone else＿who would get so disgruntled from＿having to wait!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo sabía. ¡No se me ocurre nadie＿más que se ponga tan de mal humor＿por tener que esperar!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tch.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come on, Taiga. Break time's over.＿Let's go.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vamos, Taiga. Se acabó＿el descanso. Vámonos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I jumped out of my skin a couple＿times myself! I wasn't sure what to do＿when Kitamura was grilling me, but......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Sí, yo también me llevé un par de＿sustos! No sabía qué hacer cuando＿Kitamura me interrogaba, pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「At any rate, I'm glad it worked out okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En todo caso, me alegra＿que saliera bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「On the day of the student council＿election, I ran into her third-year＿classroom, and......」"
msgstr "Taiga「El día de las elecciones del consejo＿estudiantil, entré corriendo a su＿salón de tercer año, y......」"

msgid "Taiga「We got into a big fight in front of＿everyone. Good enough for you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tuvimos una gran pelea delante＿de todos. ¿Contento con eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「There's nothing to talk about, and＿there's nothing much else to do. I've＿deigned to assign a task to those idle」"
msgstr "Taiga「No hay nada de qué hablar, y tampoco hay＿mucho más que hacer. Me he dignado a＿asignarle una tarea a esas ociosas」"

msgid "Taiga「hands of yours.」"
msgstr "Taiga「manos tuyas.」"
